  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e0f703aa99625fcc",
      "translationZh": "我想给自己做一个快捷的卡路里计算器，用 LLMs 根据餐食照片 + 描述来估算卡路里。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c7f5071edb307d73",
      "translationZh": "我需要选一个模型，所以做了一次快速基准测试。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2651a4e6074e61b0",
      "translationZh": "使用 Nutrition5k 照片获取照片 + 卡路里数据：https://github.com/google-research-datasets/Nutrition5k",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "22bb7ca600b464e9",
      "translationZh": "一个可访问 USDA FoodData Central + MEXT 卡路里信息的工具",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2c1ebbce79fdc61c",
      "translationZh": "我根据模型能将多少份餐食的估算误差控制在 20% 以下来评估它们",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a86a20d50049f306",
      "translationZh": "所有模型都使用同一组随机选取的 25 份餐食。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3e588c8ca4ddf073",
      "translationZh": "对于大到我的机器无法运行的模型，我通过 OpenCode Go/OpenRouter 来运行。我也纳入了 Spark 1.3，因为据说它会开放权重。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f4a7581f65aa54bf",
      "translationZh": "模型 误差在 20% 以内的比例 平均偏差 误差中位数",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c8243e99230420a3",
      "translationZh": "我知道这算不上最科学的基准测试，但有趣的是，排名顺序似乎与模型大小并没有多大关系。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "30ed06d2993108bd",
      "translationZh": "对我来说，最有意思的是 Muse Glimmer 30b 在这里如何碾压 Qwen 3.8 27b。我认为这凸显了：在消费级硬件（约 32Gb 显存）上，哪个模型才是“最好的”，确实取决于任务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bc1534d7dad0c580",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/mr_tolkien 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
